# Automotive Supply Chain Mini-Project

## Overview
Collaborated with a small automotive parts distributor to analyze warehouse and material planning workflows. Focused on inventory reconciliation and order-to-cash cycles to improve visibility and efficiency.

## Key Contributions
- Mapped AS-IS and TO-BE processes for inventory and billing workflows.
- Designed Excel-based dashboards to track stock levels, delivery timelines, and billing accuracy.
- Conducted order management analysis to identify bottlenecks and streamline reconciliation.
- Supported ERP integration discussions by documenting workflows and KPIs.

## Outcome
- Improved visibility of material flows.
- Reduced stock discrepancies by 12%.
- Enabled smoother ERP alignment and order-to-cash cycle management.
